        },
        {
          "text": "mubalailile kuti, Amubweze mabwe aali ikumi aabili aazwa akati ka-Jordano, mpoonya awo mpaakaimvwi maulu aabapaizi, mwaatolelezye akuyooabika nkukonya nkumuyoolala sunu.",
