        {
          "text": "muyoobapandulwida kuti, Mpoonya awa maanzi aa-Jordano mpaakatimbuka kubusyu bwabbokesi lyacizuminano ca-Jehova, ciindi eciya nilyakazubuka jordano amaanzi aa-Jordano naakatimbuka. Aya mabwe ayooba ciibalusyo kubana ba-Israyeli mazuba oonse.",
