              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bana ba-Israyeli bakacita mbubonya mbwaakabalailila Joshua. Bakabweza mabwe aali ikumi aabili aazwa akati ka-Jordano, mbuli Jehova mbwaakalailila Joshua, mbuli mweelwe wamikowa yabana ba-Israyeli, bakazubuka awo akwaatolelezya nkubakaakulala, bakaabamba nkukonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
