        {
          "text": "Nkabela bana ba-Rubeni abana ba-Gadi acisela camukowa wa-Manase boonse bakazubuka azilwisyo zyabo kunembo lyabana ba-Israyeli, mbubonya Musa mbwaakabalailila. ",
