        {
          "text": "Aboobo bantu bakazwa ku-Jordano mubuzuba bwakumi bwamwezi mutaanzi, Nkabela bakayaka zilao zyabo ku-Giligala kujwe kubambene a-Jeriko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
